@baseUrl = http://localhost:4004/sample
@dummyAuth = Basic ZHVtbXk6ZHVtbXk=

### GET todos os pets (verificar se o campo age calculado aparece)
GET {{baseUrl}}/Pets
Authorization: {{dummyAuth}}

### POST criar novo pet
POST {{baseUrl}}/Pets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{dummyAuth}}

{
  "name": "Rex",
  "species": "Dog",
  "breed": "Dachshund",
  "birthDate": "2022-06-15",
  "weight": 12.5,
  "owner_id": "81ffd7bc-8523-4d8e-8e27-db44959b2bea"
}

### GET pet específico por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/Pets(fe51eaee-f4b0-4552-9091-059ad5b769b0)
Authorization: {{dummyAuth}}

### GET com $filter por species
GET {{baseUrl}}/Pets?$filter=species eq 'Dog'
Authorization: {{dummyAuth}}